blocks.body:
I specialize in three fields:

- Classical old and new master's techniques (after studying Rubens, Caravaggio, Rembrandt, Titian, Freud and Lorca) with oils on canvas. Acrylics and even mixed media;
- Digital art by using computer programs, graphic design and illustration;
- Grand scale art such as murals, interior and exterior wall paintings.

I studied at various institutions around the world and finished my Bachelor degree in industrial design at:

- Academy of Fine Arts and Design, University of Ljubljana, Slovenia;

I acquired another Bachelor and Magister Degree for painting at the same institution. I refined my creative experimental approach to art process, developing a hybrid for creating with mixing digital and classical techniques, with additional studies at:

- Winchester School of Art, University of Southampton, United Kingdom;
- Academia de belas-artes, University of Lisbon, Portugal;

At following institution I studied classical Balinese painting:

- Pengosekan Community, Bali, Indonesia;

And refined my skills for classical European painting, specifically studying old masters in oil on canvas at:

- Angel Art Academy, Florence, Italy;

I also acquired additional education and certificate in pedagogy and andragogy to be able to efficiently pass on the knowledge and skill in art to people of various generations, backgrounds and levels of knowledge at:

- Faculty of Education, University of Maribor, Slovenia.
